{"title":"blast_security","url":"https://blast.security/blog/","favicon":"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cropped-icon-32x32.png","elements":[{"title":"The Placebo Effect of Cloud Security Visibility","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20574'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3.jpg 1344w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3.jpg 1344w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript>                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Agents                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Cloud Defense                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Native Controls                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Preemptive Defense                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    3 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                The Placebo Effect of Cloud Security Visibility            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                As cloud change accelerates and agent-driven actions reshape risk, visibility alone is no longer enough. Complementing the visibility-based operating model with prevention is the next must-have step for security teams that need to stop critical risks from materializing in the first place.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Dayana Nevo Blast\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dayana-Nevo-Blast-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dayana-Nevo-Blast-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Dayana Nevo Blast\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Dayana<br>Nevo        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/visibility-to-prevention-cloud-security/","retrieved":1782668636106},{"title":"Securing AI Infrastructure in AWS: A Preventive Guardrails Approach for the Agentic Cloud","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20574'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1.jpg 1344w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-1024x574.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Securing-AI-Infrastructure-in-AWS_-A-Preventive-Guardrails-Approach-for-the-Agentic-Cloud-1.jpg 1344w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript>                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Agents                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AWS Guardrails                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Cloud Defense                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Misconfigurations                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Preemptive Defense                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    17 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                Securing AI Infrastructure in AWS: A Preventive Guardrails Approach for the Agentic Cloud            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                AI agents are changing the cloud security boundary, connecting models, tools, identities, data, and production workflows. This blog explains why prompt-level safety is not enough, and how AWS-native controls like Bedrock Guardrails, IAM, SCPs, permission boundaries, and AgentCore policies can create preventive guardrails that stop unsafe cloud actions before they reach production.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Roi<br>Panai        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/securing-ai-infrastructure-aws-preventive-guardrails/","retrieved":1782668636107},{"title":"The Mythos Lesson: Your Cloud Needs to Defend Itself","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog-1024x576.png\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog-1024x576.png 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog-300x169.png 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog-768x432.png 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog-1536x864.png 1536w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blast-Mythos-POV-Blog.png 1672w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Threat                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Native Controls                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Preemptive Defense                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    10 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                The Mythos Lesson: Your Cloud Needs to Defend Itself            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                Claude Mythos proved that every organization should assume vulnerabilities will be found and breaches can happen. But the attack chain only starts there. The real cloud security test is how far your environment lets an attacker go. As AI accelerates attack-path discovery, the answer is not faster response alone. It is a hardened, secure-by-design cloud architecture that blocks the attacker’s next move before it succeeds.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Roi<br>Panai        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/claude-mythos-zero-day-cloud-security-architecture/","retrieved":1782668636107},{"title":"Three Signals from RSA Conference That Redefine Cloud Security","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20574'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1024x574.png 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-300x168.png 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-768x430.png 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1536x861.png 1536w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-2048x1147.png 2048w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1024x574.png\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1024x574.png\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1024x574.png 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-300x168.png 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-768x430.png 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-1536x861.png 1536w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Three-Signals-from-RSA-Conference-That-Redefine-Cloud-Security-2048x1147.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript>                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Agents                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Threat                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Preemptive Defense                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    7 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                Three Signals from RSA Conference That Redefine Cloud Security            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                RSA Conference 2026 reveals how AI-driven threats and autonomous agents are accelerating the shift toward self-defending cloud security.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Roi<br>Panai        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/three-signals-from-rsa-conference-that-redefine-cloud-security/","retrieved":1782668636109}]}